      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "8−2√15=(√5−√3)^2.\n\nTherefore √(8−2√15)=√5−√3.\n\nThe larger root comes first so the principal square root stays positive.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_2"
